# ============================================================
# Secrets file EXAMPLE — safe to share, contains NO real values.
#
# How to use:
#   1. Copy this file and name the copy exactly:  .env
#   2. Fill in the real values in .env (never in this file!)
#   3. Ask the system owner (usually Marco) for real values.
#      They are shared via the password manager — never via chat.
#
# The .env file is ignored by git and never leaves your computer.
# ============================================================

# Example entry (delete or replace with your app's real variables):
# MY_SERVICE_API_KEY=your-key-here   # one line on where to get it
